 "revision": "r0, 2026-10-29",
 "source": "hardware/bench-breadboard-r0/build-sheet.md as committed at c7e8860 (origin/master, 2026-10-29), git blob 7f82e20f3ed233cf1fe464b1224564ffe2c14a7f: the r0 interim sheet the 2026-10-28/29 bench was built from. Parsed once from its jumper and lead tables (that sheet has no lead table); a_at and b_at name the part pins on each end's strip, from its parts table. The D1 as-run deviations (the pack in the charger's BATT socket, the shunt bypassed) are in the README history, not here. Part ids in a_at and b_at follow the current model: the r0 sheet's C1 and C2 (the cups and rain filter capacitors) are C_CUPS and C_RAIN here, so no end reads like pre-run checklist rows C1 and C2."
